    "name": "Strider Arena",
    "steam_appid": 3394790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394790/extras/beee96d17a0fffdf7629ca604888f22b.avif?t=1753336094\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span>Prepare for drop in Strider Arena, a mobility mech arena shooter for you and some friends to duke it out. Last team standing wins, so kit out your strider and make sure the only team left is yours! Equip up to 4 unique weapons at a time for adaptability and solid performance in any situation, or go all in with 4 Lasers and melt yourself to slag seconds after vaporizing all your friends. Harass opponents from a distance with railguns, or rush them down with shotguns and grappling hooks. Play it safe with low risk weapons, or bet your life on one hugely damaging shot with the ion projector. Weapons in Strider Arena are designed to encourage a wide variety of playstyles, keeping gameplay fresh, and your enemies guessing. If 4 weapon slots wasn't enough customization, chassis mods may be the final piece you need to cement your build. Chassis mods are doled out between rounds and affect the core stats of your strider, often having both upsides and downsides. Choose the right chassis mod with the right weapons, and you'll truly be a force to be reckoned with in the arena. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394790/extras/beee96d17a0fffdf7629ca604888f22b.avif?t=1753336094\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span>Prepare for drop in Strider Arena, a mobility mech arena shooter for you and some friends to duke it out. Last team standing wins, so kit out your strider and make sure the only team left is yours! Equip up to 4 unique weapons at a time for adaptability and solid performance in any situation, or go all in with 4 Lasers and melt yourself to slag seconds after vaporizing all your friends. Harass opponents from a distance with railguns, or rush them down with shotguns and grappling hooks. Play it safe with low risk weapons, or bet your life on one hugely damaging shot with the ion projector. Weapons in Strider Arena are designed to encourage a wide variety of playstyles, keeping gameplay fresh, and your enemies guessing. If 4 weapon slots wasn't enough customization, chassis mods may be the final piece you need to cement your build. Chassis mods are doled out between rounds and affect the core stats of your strider, often having both upsides and downsides. Choose the right chassis mod with the right weapons, and you'll truly be a force to be reckoned with in the arena. </p>",
    "short_description": "Strider Arena is a fast-paced mobility mech arena fighter designed to be played with a group of friends. Inspired by the likes of Titanfall 2, Armored Core, and Hawken, kit out your strider, drop into the arena, and make sure your team is the only one left standing once the smoke clears.",
